// Managed in-context design (`managed-in-context-design.md` MC1–MC4) on the Edit in context
// stand-in (`fixtures/context_standin.cadrs`: in Assembly 1 a Base plate 140 × 90 × 10 mm with
// two Ø10 holes at x ±40, and a Cover plate 120 × 80 × 6 mm on top of it, fixed).
// 01 (MC2.2, MC2.3, MCC1, MCC2) Cover <1>'s menu: Edit in context: the Cover studio with the
//    Base as a ghost, the bar "Context 1 of Assembly 1 · Cover <1>" with Done, Select
//    transparent geometry and the transparency slider; the Feature list's Assembly contexts row.
// 02 (MC2.5) Done without referencing it: no context is left (no Assembly contexts row).
// 03 Edit in context again; a sketch on the Base's top face, Use on its two hole edges: the
//    first reference creates the context; Sketch 2 has the yellow in-context arrow (MC2.6).
// 04 (MC2.13) ⋯ → Rename… : "Base flush".
// 05 (MC2.7, MC3.1) Go to assembly ▾: the menu (Go to assembly, Insert and go to assembly).
// 06 (MC3.1) the assembly: Cover <1> has the solid arrow (the primary instance).
// 07 (MC4.3, MC4.4) the Base moved 15 mm along X: the Cover's arrow gets the blue dot; nothing
//    in the Cover moved.
// 08 (MC2.14) Cover <1>'s menu: Edit in context ▸ Base flush, New context.
// 09 (MC1.7, MC2.15) New context: Context 2 at the new position; a sketch on the Base's top face
//    there: Sketch 3's arrow is yellow, Sketch 2's grey (another context) with the blue dot.
// 10 (MC2.12) the context drop-down: Base flush, Context 2, Edit outside of context.
// 11 (MC4.2) Base flush picked: its ghost (where the Base was), Sketch 2's arrow yellow.
// 12 (MC2.3) transparency slider to the right, Select transparent geometry off.
// 13 (MC4.7) ⋯ → Update context: Base flush takes the Base where it is now (the dot goes).
// 14 (MC2.12) Edit outside of context: no ghost, every arrow grey.
// 15 (MC2.13) Context 2 picked, ⋯ → Delete context: Sketch 3 stays where it was, without arrow.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        Custom("fixture context_standin"),
        Click(ui("tab-assembly-1")),
        Custom("view 25 35 0 0 0 0.16"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-2")),
        WaitFor("asm-edit-in-context"),
        Click(ui("asm-edit-in-context")),
        WaitFor("context-bar"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-mc2-edit-in-context"),
        Click(ui("context-done")),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-mc2-5-done-no-context-left"),
